# Cloudflare Pages security headers. challenges.cloudflare.com = Turnstile on the
# redeem form (script-src + frame-src + connect-src, same as loantechies' contact form).
# Study-resource media (audio/video/pdf/image) is same-origin now -- served through
# /api/media/:file (signed, short-lived URLs via examprep-api's R2 binding) rather than
# a public R2 custom domain, so no external media host needs a CSP allowance.
# js.stripe.com/api.stripe.com/hooks.stripe.com = Stripe.js Payment Element on the /buy flow
# (card + Apple Pay + Google Pay), per Stripe's documented CSP requirements. PayPal's Smart
# Buttons were replaced by Stripe here (2026-08) -- the PayPal backend integration is left
# intact for now (see lib/paypal.js) but the frontend no longer loads anything from paypal.com,
# so its CSP allowances were dropped too.
# No other external origins needed — the API call is same-origin via worker.js's proxy.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://js.stripe.com https://*.js.stripe.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; media-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://api.stripe.com; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://js.stripe.com https://*.js.stripe.com https://hooks.stripe.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# The embeddable Question of the Day widget (wwwroot/embed/qotd/) is designed to be iframed on
# arbitrary THIRD-PARTY sites -- the entire point of the feature -- which directly conflicts with
# the site-wide frame-ancestors 'self' above. Override CSP here with frame-ancestors * for this
# path only; every other directive stays 'self'-only (script/style are external files, not inline,
# specifically so this scoped CSP never needs 'unsafe-inline'). The site-wide X-Frame-Options:
# SAMEORIGIN above still applies alongside this (Cloudflare Pages headers rules are additive, not
# replacing), but per the CSP spec, frame-ancestors takes precedence over X-Frame-Options in every
# browser that supports both (all current browsers) -- the same mechanism that lets YouTube/Twitter
# embeds work despite X-Frame-Options existing. No Stripe/Turnstile allowances needed here -- this
# page has no payment form or Turnstile widget.
/embed/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors *
